  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1970-100/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.635442
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Even the impossible is not impossible if resolution is there, and even the possible becomes impossible if one lacks will.",
      "path": "audio/1970-100/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.911451,
      "end": 9.58644
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "The world we live in is our own creation.",
      "path": "audio/1970-100/03.mp3",
      "start": 10.930363000000002,
      "end": 13.671406
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "The time gap between sowing and reaping creates confusion.",
      "path": "audio/1970-100/04.mp3",
      "start": 14.993696,
      "end": 18.842086000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Because cause and effect are so separated the mind fails to understand what would otherwise be obvious.",
      "path": "audio/1970-100/05.mp3",
      "start": 20.202222,
      "end": 26.334059
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Nothing is fragmented or disconnected The missing links are always there if you look deeply.",
      "path": "audio/1970-100/06.mp3",
      "start": 27.622971,
      "end": 33.768933999999994
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Understanding the life process opens the door to peace.",
      "path": "audio/1970-100/07.mp3",
      "start": 35.081429,
      "end": 38.542313
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "The light lies close by, waiting for the seeker.",
      "path": "audio/1970-100/08.mp3",
      "start": 40.074807,
      "end": 44.49
    }
  ]
}
